  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Business Incubators in Centers for Youth and Employment in Cusco and San Juan de Miraflores in Lima</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Kallpa para la Promocin de la Salud Integral y el Desarrollo (Kallpa) will adapt its tools and incorporate a new methodology for preparing young persons with disabilities for employment. Approximately 210 youth with disabilities and 40 volunteers in Cusco and in the district of San Juan de Miraflores, in Lima, will benefit.</narrative>
